sion (RPD)...''"}, {"id": "q10", "question": "Daniel Kahneman received a Nobel Memorial Prize in Economic Sciences.", "user_answer": "", "correct_answer": "NOT GIVEN", "is_correct": false, "explanation": "M\u1eb7c d\u00f9 ngo\u00e0i \u0111\u1eddi Daniel Kahneman \u0111o\u1ea1t gi\u1ea3i Nobel, nh\u01b0ng trong n\u1ed9i dung b\u00e0i \u0111\u1ecdc tr\u00ean KH\u00d4NG nh\u1eafc t\u1edbi th\u00f4ng tin n\u00e0y."}]', '2026-09-09 02:25:41', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
