e ubiquitous surveillance required by facial recognition cameras... the line between civic optimization and state surveillance blurs rapidly''."}, {"id": "q5", "question": "Hyper-connected cities are vulnerable because a cyberattack could disable either the traffic system or the ________.", "user_answer": "power grid", "correct_answer": "power grid", "is_correct": true, "explanation": "\u0110o\u1ea1n cu\u1ed1i vi\u1ebft: ''...could cripple traffic networks or the power grid for millions of residents''."}, {"id": "q6", "question": "According to the passage, historically, Western philosophy viewed intuition as:", "user_answer": "", "correct_answer": "An unscientific and inferior form of judgment", "is_correct": false, "explanation": "\u0110o\u1ea1n 1 n\u00eau r\u00f5: ''Gut feelings and intuitive impulses were frequently dismissed as unscientific superstitions''."}, {"id": "q7", "question": "Which of the following best characterizes Kahneman''s ''System 1''?", "user_answer": "", "correct_answer": "Fast, effortless, and associative", "is_correct": false, "explanation": "\u0110o\u1ea1n 2 n\u00eau: ''System 1 operates automatically, swiftly, and with minimal voluntary effort. It is associative, emotionally charged...''"}, {"id": "q8", "question": "Experienced firefighters usually list several strategies and analyze the benefits of each before acting.", "user_answer": "", "correct_answer": "FALSE", "is_correct": false, "explanation": "\u0110o\u1ea1n 3 vi\u1ebft: ''seasoned fire captains rarely compare multiple courses of action. Instead, their subconscious instantly matches current perceptual cues...'' (hi\u1ebfm khi so s\u00e1nh nhi\u1ec1u ph\u01b0\u01a1ng \u00e1n)."}, {"id": "q9", "question": "Gary Klein coined the term ''________'' to describe the rapid matching of cues to past experiences.", "user_answer": "", "correct_answer": "Recognition-Primed Decision", "is_correct": false, "explanation": "\u0110o\u1ea1n 3 vi\u1ebft: ''This process, termed Recognition-Primed Decision (RPD)...''"}, {"id": "q10", "question": "Daniel Kahneman received a Nobel Memorial Prize in Economic Sciences.", "user_answer": "", "correct_answer": "NOT GIVEN", "is_correct": false, "explanation": "M\u1eb7c d\u00f9 ngo\u00e0i \u0111\u1eddi Daniel Kahneman \u0111o\u1ea1t gi\u1ea3i Nobel, nh\u01b0ng trong n\u1ed9i dung b\u00e0i \u0111\u1ecdc tr\u00ean KH\u00d4NG nh\u1eafc t\u1edbi th\u00f4ng tin n\u00e0y."}]', '2026-09-09 02:53:42', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
